      "id": "02-open",
      "instruction": "Open the {{01-signin.app_menu_contacts}} app (via the apps menu in the top-left). Create a new contact/company record: an individual customer named exactly '{{runid}} Bench Customer' (use the Name field), with the City field set to 'Benchville' (fill the City field under the address section; if there is an address format, make sure City specifically reads Benchville). Save the record. Then verify by reopening/reading the record and report the exact Name and City values shown on the saved record. Do not wait for network idle; wait for concrete page state.",
      "skill": "s_58b0ea",
      "params": {
